					"quantity": null
				},
				{
					"ingredient": 19,
					"phrase": "and",
					"amountPhrase": null,
					"quantity": null
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"text": "In a large bowl using a handheld or stand mixer fitted with a paddle attachment, beat the cream cheese and butter together on medium-high speed until smooth, about 2 minutes. Scrape down the sides of the bowl as needed. Add the confectioners’ sugar, vanilla, and a pinch of salt. Beat on low speed for 30 seconds, then increase to high speed and beat for 3 minutes until completely combined and creamy. If the frosting seems a bit thin and runny, refrigerate it for 30 minutes before using.",
			"section": null,
			"timer": null,
			"uses": [
